      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STICKY FORTUNE (2) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 1.75 lengths into second (17.66) at this track in a Maiden over 300m. Expected to feature in the finish again. MIXED EMOTIONS (3) eye-catching debut run after settling well back but winding up strongly into the frame when second (17.72) at this track over 300m. This looks easier and expected to improve further. ARCADIA PRIZE (1) is yet to break through in 13 starts but has run a number of placings. Missed the frame when fourth (17.91) at this track latest but was in the placings the start before. Leading chance. WATCHING BIRDS (4) is a newcomer from the Sarah Fellowes kennel. Start all important from the squeeze box. Profiles well so pay to keep very safe.",
